  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><mtext>C</mtext><msub><mrow><mtext>l</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> cannot displace <math><msub><mrow><mtext>F</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> but <math><msub><mrow><mtext>F</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>2&nbsp;</mn></mrow></msub></math>can displace <math><mtext>C</mtext><msub><mrow><mtext>l</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> on account of its higher electronegativity.<br /><br />The SRP value of <math><msub><mrow><mtext>F</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>2&nbsp;</mn></mrow></msub></math>is highest in the electrochemtextcal series. So it will oxidise chlorine."
